    [38;5;153muser, userId }[39m and the caller logs it. Buys you real identity tracking, costs a change to the return shape (any
    caller reading the result is affected — here, just the one), and rules out nothing later.
  - [1mTake a caller-supplied [38;5;153muserId[39m parameter[0m — matches your words literally, but the caller has nothing real to pass, so
